            <history xml:id="history_idd70ce008">
               <p xml:id="idm106">Ernst von der Recke's play "Bertran de Born" had its first performance at the Royal Theatre in Copenhagen on 7 January 1873 with songs and incidental music by Peter Heise. It stayed on the repertoire until March 1875. Whether Gade wrote his overture for the play or as a concert overture is unknown.</p>
            </history>
